abstract: >
  One-day snapshot (2026-09-16) of open data-role job advertisements in Austria collected from five public
  sources plus the AMS JobBarometer yearly series 2020-2025, normalised with transparent rule-based
  taxonomies and summarised into aggregated tables, figures and decision documents. The public repository
  contains code, methodology, configuration and aggregated statistics only; source records and advertisement
  texts are retained privately.
